{"title": "Hoots' Hooch", "pageid": 19528, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Hoots'_Hooch", "categories": ["Consumables", "Uncommon items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Faded.png/300px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/5/54/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Hoots' Hooch image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Faded.png/300px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Hoots' Hooch</span></a> is a consumable item which grants one of ten random conditions after a <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\">Wild Magic</a> check.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A new invention of the Sharess' Caress bartender Hoots - like being decked in the sobriety.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consumables\" title=\"Consumables\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/38px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Consumables\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Consumables\" title=\"Consumables\">Consumables</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/38px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Single Use\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Single Use</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Uncommon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Uncommon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 100 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  100  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-ebc8db22ce4f2ff6END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-9b33bab2b415733fEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">WYR_SharessCaress_PotentDrink</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:WYR_SharessCaress_PotentDrink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:WYR_SharessCaress_PotentDrink\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">14a43b9d-0913-4a24-8f19-a2db6e87bc36</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:14a43b9d-0913-4a24-8f19-a2db6e87bc36\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:14a43b9d-0913-4a24-8f19-a2db6e87bc36\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"> <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Consume to receive a random condition (effects listed below)</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Bought or gifted from bartender <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots_Hooligan\" title=\"Hoots Hooligan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Hoots_Hooligan.png/25px-Portrait_Hoots_Hooligan.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Hoots_Hooligan.png/38px-Portrait_Hoots_Hooligan.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Hoots_Hooligan.png/50px-Portrait_Hoots_Hooligan.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hoots Hooligan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Hoots_Hooligan.png/25px-Portrait_Hoots_Hooligan.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Hoots_Hooligan.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hoots_Hooligan\" title=\"Hoots Hooligan\">Hoots Hooligan</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Sharess%27_Caress\" title=\"Sharess' Caress\">Sharess' Caress</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Purity_of_Body\" title=\"Purity of Body\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Purity_of_Body_Icon.webp/20px-Purity_of_Body_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Purity_of_Body_Icon.webp/30px-Purity_of_Body_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Purity_of_Body_Icon.webp/40px-Purity_of_Body_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Purity of Body\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Purity_of_Body_Icon.webp/20px-Purity_of_Body_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Purity_of_Body_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Purity_of_Body\" title=\"Purity of Body\">Purity of Body</a> makes <a href=\"/wiki/Monks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Monks\">Monks</a> immune to the effects of Hoot's Hooch.</li>\n<li>If <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Blackout_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Blackout (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hoots' Hooch: Blackout\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a6/Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Blackout_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Blackout (Condition)\">Hoots' Hooch: Blackout</a> is the randomized outcome of consuming the hooch, the consumer will wake up inside <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock_Prison\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock Prison\">Wyrm's Rock Prison</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span id=\"Hoots.27_Hooch_effects\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Hoots'_Hooch_effects\">Hoots' Hooch effects</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Effect\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Duration\n</th>\n<th style=\"width: 750px;\" scope=\"col\">Description\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Bad_Breath_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Bad Breath (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bad Breath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Bad_Breath_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Bad Breath (Condition)\">Bad Breath</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\">10\n</td>\n<td>Characters attacking you in melee become <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nauseous_(Condition)\" title=\"Nauseous (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nauseous\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nauseous_(Condition)\" title=\"Nauseous (Condition)\">Nauseous</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Beast_Tongue_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Beast Tongue (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Beast Tongue\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Beast_Tongue_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Beast Tongue (Condition)\">Beast Tongue</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\">20\n</td>\n<td>You're pretty sure you could speak to animals if you tried. Grants <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Animal_Handling\" title=\"Animal Handling\">Animal Handling</a> checks against <a href=\"/wiki/Beast\" title=\"Beast\">Beasts</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Blackout_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Blackout (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blackout\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a6/Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Blackout_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Blackout (Condition)\">Blackout</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\">5\n</td>\n<td>Character is unconscious.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blink_(Condition)\" title=\"Blink (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blink\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blink_(Condition)\" title=\"Blink (Condition)\">Blink</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\">10\n</td>\n<td>Blink between the material and ethereal plane in your drunken stupor.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_(Condition)\" title=\"Otto's Irresistible Dance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dancing Fool\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_(Condition)\" title=\"Otto's Irresistible Dance (Condition)\">Dancing Fool</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\">2\n</td>\n<td>Begin an elaborate jig that stops you from taking movement and actions, gives you <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on attacks and Dexterity <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throws\">Saving Throws</a>. Enemies have <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on attacks against you while you boogie.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Gifted_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Gifted (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gifted\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Gifted_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Gifted (Condition)\">Gifted</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\">20\n</td>\n<td>You can read minds, but become <a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vulnerable\">Vulnerable</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Photosensitivity_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Photosensitivity (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Photosensitivity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Photosensitivity_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Photosensitivity (Condition)\">Photosensitivity</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\">10\n</td>\n<td>Become <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blin